塞米松活性药口服 + 合成药K匹配静脉输注安慰剂\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"schedules\": [\n      {\n        \"period_id\": \"experimental_cycle_28d\",\n        \"arm_id\": \"experimental_k\",\n        \"steps\": [\n          {\n            \"kind\": \"single\",\n            \"timing\": \"每28天周期第1天；以0.9%氯化钠注射液稀释至最终体积250 mL，配制后室温4小时内完成约2小时静脉输注；不设负荷剂量\",\n            \"frequency\": \"Q4W（每28天一次）\",\n            \"route\": \"静脉输注\",\n            \"products\": [\n              {\n                \"name\": \"合成药K\",\n                \"dose\": {\n                  \"value\": 5,\n                  \"unit\": \"mg/kg\"\n                },\n                \"volume\": {\n                  \"value\": 250,\n                  \"unit\": \"mL\"\n                }\n              }\n            ],\n            \"references\": []\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"period_id\": \"control_cycle_28d\",\n        \"arm_id\": \"control_rd\",\n        \"steps\": [\n          {\n            \"kind\": \"maintenance\",\n            \"timing\": \"每28天周期第1-21天\",\n            \"frequency\": \"每日一次（QD）\",\n            \"route\": \"口服\",\n            \"products\": [\n              {\n                \"name\": \"来那度胺\",\n                \"dose\": {\n                  \"value\": 25,\n                  \"unit\": \"mg\"\n                },\n                \"volume\": null\n              }\n            ],\n            \"references\": []\n          },\n          {\n            \"kind\": \"maintenance\",\n            \"timing\": \"每28天周期第1、8、15、22天\",\n            \"frequency\": \"每28天周期的第1、8、15、22天\",\n            \"route\": \"口服\",\n            \"products\": [\n              {\n                \"name\": \"地塞米松\",\n                \"dose\": {\n                  \"value\": 40,\n                  \"unit\": \"mg\"\n                },\n                \"volume\": null\n              }\n            ],\n            \"references\": []\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"unresolved_questions\": [\n      